hadiths[2]{hadithnumber,text}:
"3","[AI-translation] Imepokelewa kutoka kwa Yusuf ibn Abdillah ibn Salam amesema: Nabii (Swalla Allahu 'alayhi wa sallam) alipokaa akizungumza, mara nyingi aliinua macho yake mbinguni."
"4","[AI-translation] Imepokelewa kutoka kwa Abdillah ibn Salam (Allah amridhie) kwamba Nabii (Swalla Allahu 'alayhi wa sallam) alipozungumza [na kisha akasimulia kama hadithi iliyotangulia]."
